# Velasia Airways on Railway: the project's shared variables (Milestone 9). PLACEHOLDERS ONLY.
#
# These two secrets are created in the Railway dashboard (Project Settings -> Shared Variables,
# production environment) and referenced from .railway/railway.ts as ctx.shared.<NAME> by all
# three services. Generate the values on your own machine; never commit them, never pass them as
# Docker build arguments, never print them in logs, never use a NEXT_PUBLIC_ name.
#
#   openssl rand -hex 32    # RETAILING_API_SERVICE_TOKEN (32+ characters)
#   openssl rand -hex 24    # METRICS_TOKEN (16+ characters)
#
# This file is documentation: nothing reads it. See docs/deployment/railway-environment-variables.md.

RETAILING_API_SERVICE_TOKEN=<generate-with-openssl-rand-hex-32>
METRICS_TOKEN=<generate-with-openssl-rand-hex-24>
